Third-party notices for the Inkling 2 Mini work on this branch (inkling-3090)
=============================================================================

Project Maya / maya-ik2 (https://github.com/alesha-pro/maya-inkling-mini), MIT License
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The tensor-core attention scan in ggml/src/ggml-cuda/inkling.cu (ik_mma16816, ik_u8x2_to_h2, ik_mma_lane, ik_mma_init,
ik_mma_step, ik_mma_finish and inkling_attn_scan_kernel) is adapted from attn_decode_mma_kernel and its helpers in
src/ik2/ik2_kernels.cu of that repository: K as the A operand of mma.sync m16n8k16 read straight from the cache, the
P V product with two dims of four keys per lane, the per-lane-group online softmax, and the conversion of small integers
to FP16 by building the bit pattern 0x6400 | n and subtracting. The cache format (ggml Q8_0 instead of FP8 E4M3), the
per-block scale handling and the two-limb FP16 operands are this branch's own.

